SUMMARY:Asheville Area Job Hunters
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nJust getting started in job search or feel
 ing stuck? Don't go it alone because it can be an emotional roller coaster
 .\n\nInstead\, join us for one\, two\, or all three parts of this meetup:\
 n\n**1:30 pm \\| The Emotional Track**\n*Whether you're in job search thro
 ugh your own choice or someone else's\, the experience raises fears\, hope
 s\, and everything in between. We'll acknowledge that and help you create 
 a mindset to move forward.*\n\n**2:30 pm \\| The Strategy Track**\n*Before
  you started job search\, you had a routine. Now\, it's turned upside down
 . We'll look at the best ways to spend your time - and more importantly he
 lp you figure out how to actually follow-through.*\n\n**3:30 pm \\| The Co
 mmunity Track**\n*Job search can be isolating. In part three of the meetup
 \, it won't be. Share your objectives\, talk about your challenges\, get s
 ome new leads and ideas\, and help others do the same.*\n\n## Attendees
