SUMMARY:BlueSmokeAVL Monthly Blues Dance
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nBlueSmoke is Asheville’s home for tradit
 ional blues dancing\, a space to move\, connect\, and get lost in the musi
 c.\nEach month\, on the 3rd Saturday\, we gather to explore the roots of b
 lues through dance\, starting with an accessible lesson and followed by a 
 social dance open to all levels. Whether you're brand new or have been dan
 cing for years\, you’re welcome here.\nCome as you are. Bring your curio
 sity\, your rhythm\, and your love of blues music.\n\nSocial dancing is a 
 great way for introverts to socialize because you can connect with people 
 without a lot of small talk. Also great for extroverts because it is like 
 a party.\n\nNo partner required- bring a friend or make them there (or bot
 h). We all dance with everyone as well as solo.\nContinuing class 7- 7:45\
 nFundamentals 7:45-8:30\nOpen dance 8:30-11\nMusic curated by local DJs\n\
 n$15 cash or venmo at the door\n\\- volunteer= free admission\n\nWear some
 thing comfortable and shoes that slide (leather-soled if you have them)\nB
 ring water and any snacks you may need for the evening.\nCheck out BlueSmo
 keAVL on the socials for more FAQs
