SUMMARY:The Next Five: Build ADN’s 2027 Together
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nEver wondered how AVL Digital Nomads actua
 lly works\, who makes it happen\, and where it’s headed next? Come find 
 out\, and help decide.\n\nADN has almost 6\,000 members and zero employees
 . Every social\, lunch\, book club\, and workshop on our calendar exists b
 ecause a nomad decided it should. This evening is a look behind the curtai
 n: where we’ve been\, where we’re going\, and the many ways to be part
  of it. It’s built as much for people who joined this year as for longti
 me regulars.\n\nWe’re gathering where ADN began in 2021: Wedge Brewing a
 t Foundation\, in the new community room they built after Helene. It felt 
 like the right place to start the next chapter.\n\n**What happens**\n\n* *
 *Where ADN is headed:** A short\, honest look at the mission and what’s 
 next.\n* **“My First Event” stories:** Longtime organizers share how t
 hey got started\, mishaps included.\n* **The Idea Wall:** Ideas from RSVPs
  go up on the wall. Add yours and vote with dot stickers. Have an idea alr
 eady? Share it when you RSVP. It’s optional\n* **The No-Shark Tank:** An
 yone can pitch an event idea in 60 seconds. Nobody gets eaten\, and listen
 ing counts.\n* **Huddles:** Join the conversation that interests you. Some
  people leave with a plan\, and everyone leaves knowing more nomads than t
 hey came with.\n\nCome curious. No idea\, commitment\, or experience requi
 red.\n\nPlenty of free parking.\nNon-alcoholic drinks available.\nFood tru
 ck: Burger Boy
