SUMMARY:Agenda Keeper Launch Party!
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**AVL Tech Connect: Product Launch Party!*
 *\nFriday\, December 4 · 6:30 to 10 PM\nThe Mule at Devil’s Foot\, Ashe
 ville\, NC\nFree and open to the public\n\nAfter countless hours of design
  and development\, extended user interviews and surveys\, dedicated UX whi
 teboard sessions\, and product meetings (so many meetings)\, [Agenda Keepe
 r](https://agendakeeper.com) is officially launching to the public\, and w
 e want to celebrate with the community that helped shape it.\n\nJoin us at
  The Mule at Devil’s Foot for a night with a DJ\, a live band\, and a fo
 od truck. This one is about taking a moment to enjoy what we built and to 
 cheer on the local team behind it.\n\n**What to expect**\n\n* Music from a
  DJ and a live band\n* Food truck eats\n* A quick\, casual hello about wha
 t Agenda Keeper is and why we built it\n* Time to meet the team at Aktiga 
 and connect with Asheville’s tech community\n\nAgenda Keeper is a meetin
 g agenda tool built by the friendly folks at [Aktiga](https://aktiga.com) 
 that helps teams plan and manage recurring meetings\, collaborate on notes
 \, capture key decisions\, and follow through on action items. It’s free
  to start. No pitch deck\, no hard sell. Come say hi\, grab a beverage (lo
 ts of great NA options!)\, and celebrate with us.\n\nEveryone is welcome. 
 Tech folks\, nomads\, founders\, and friends.\nNo Agenda? No Thanks. 🙌
