SUMMARY:Why Your Resolutions Fail by February (and How to Make This Year D
 ifferent)
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nEvery January we set big intentions\, and 
 by February most of them have quietly disappeared. It’s rarely about wil
 lpower. Usually two things get in the way: practical obstacles we haven’
 t planned for\, and beliefs running underneath that pull us back to the ol
 d pattern.\n\nIn this 2-hour evening workshop\, you’ll design the year y
 ou want and then take apart what’s been stopping you\, at both levels.\n
 \n**What we’ll do together:**\n\n* Take a guided meditation into your id
 eal life\, to get clear on what you really want.\n* Map your goals across 
 the six key areas of life\n* Pick one goal and identify its practical obst
 acles\, then turn them into simple\, doable next steps\n* Uncover any beli
 efs holding you back from your goal and keeping you stuck.\n* Learn neurop
 lasticity-based tools you can use on your own to start rewiring that belie
 f keeping you stuck.\n\nYou’ll leave with a clear goal\, a realistic set
  of the first few baby steps and a worksheet to keep using all year.\n\n**
 Who it’s for:** remote workers\, freelancers\, founders and anyone tired
  of starting the year strong and fading by spring.\n**What to bring:** the
  goal you’re tired of failing at. Worksheets provided.\n**Your host:** J
 amie Leavitt is a certified coach\, an RTT® hypnotherapist and the founde
 r of The Inner Rewrite. After 25 years in corporate including 13 coaching 
 leaders\, she now helps high achievers get to the root of what keeps them 
 stuck.\nSpots are limited to 40.
